{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$f''$ is the *second derivative* of $f$. In other words, it's the derivative of $f'$, which is the derivative of $f$.\n\nBecause of this, we need to differentiate $f$ twice in order to find $f''(x)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $f'(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nf'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[(2x+1)^5\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=10(2x+1)^4\n\\end{align}$\n\n[[☃ explanation 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\nf'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[(2x+1)^5\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5(2x+1)^4\\dfrac{d}{dx}(2x+1)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5(2x+1)^4(2)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=10(2x+1)^4\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show entire calculation.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"Now we can differentiate $f'$ to find $f''(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nf''(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[10(2x+1)^4\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=80(2x+1)^3\n\\end{align}$\n\n[[☃ explanation 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\nf''(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[10(2x+1)^4\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=10\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[(2x+1)^4\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=10\\left(4(2x+1)^3\\right)\\dfrac{d}{dx}(2x+1)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=40(2x+1)^3(2)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=80(2x+1)^3\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show entire calculation.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"In conclusion, $f''(x)=80(2x+1)^3$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Let $f(x)=(2x+1)^5$.\n\n**Find $f''(x)$.**\n\n$f''(x)=$ [[☃ expression 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":"0","simplify":false,"value":"80\\left(2x+1\\right)^{3}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"static":false,"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
